From: ios-mh2lm
Subject: mh2lm: discover PMIC mux per consumer and synchronize termination

Replace the C singleton/readiness bridge with matching and terminated
notifications. Give keys an IOService owner and expose identity-checked
C++ attachConsumer/detachConsumer. Quiesce consumers before releasing
callbacks, notifiers, worker threads and releasable observer mappings.

